  "_comment": [
    "Each target's battery seconds on each host, the median over recent main",
    "runs of the per-target lines integ-shared-{py,ts} print at the end of",
    "their battery step. shard.py splits the shard jobs by these rather than",
    "by case count: a case on a remote fake costs several times one on ram,",
    "so equal case counts left one shard minutes behind the other. A target",
    "missing here weighs its case count at the host's average seconds per",
    "case; a target named here that the host no longer runs fails the gate",
    "selftest. Refresh when the per-target lines drift far from these."
